      "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8;\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;\">KC桌面——外资精译</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4;\">美元/人民币中间价模型：预测值：6.7698</p></section>\n<h2 style=\"margin:24px 0 12px;color:#152033;font-size:22px;line-height:1.35;\">美元/人民币中间价模型</h2>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4;\">预测值：6.7698</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px;\">模型预测值：6.7698，前值为6.8203（下调505个基点；较前一日官方收盘价下调70个基点）。</p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4;\">亚洲外汇策略</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center;\"><img src=\"http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOVdZtlB6LXOOP1BwQUoCHWvTzRcYfJian6xiaflHRd6xf7YcBQo2Wppfwx5F3A2QDMeEXwZ0F7pvicAX5ySqluejE0ia1jUvDRicpNc/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"[[KC_IMAGE_001]]\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;\" /></p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center;\"><img src=\"http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWvjCibrjV27zN00BLoeRONFDKRRK1dGcyeD35uDGRicEoXGzBonBfgjt7xtMpZypkbq9xMWic7Kws27m7xfvjhCMQ7qtM7HDMw5I/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"[[KC_IMAGE_002]]\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;\" /></p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center;\"><img src=\"http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOUiaEtCmnepGrXbjZ2ZhafUQX1ib8Gibhp62CFwDERJr8kV9mGlBZ1JplLTc4Ahdia9pfSiaOibGNSgVMx5u9YbiaQZGU2hL5NW3E1Xf0/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"[[KC_IMAGE_003]]\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;\" /></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4;\">附录A-1</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:24px 0 12px;padding:14px 16px;background:#F7F3E8;border-left:4px solid #C9A227;color:#152033;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600;\">更多完整报告和后续精译，扫文末图片进群交流。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;\">For informational purposes only. Not investment advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center;\"><img src=\"http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXnZO8xMUpgCyibCSJ3xrLLK4xmIqicS0d5ib1Wv7SQqwF8biaUvG22xH5DsSmWrA8ia8icib9m0wpSAsaotG7qCRJFTLtMy9qDwcIoXI/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"KC Desk\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;\" /></p>",
